    "description": "<p>Spend a Hope to call a cyber-beast or<br>scout drone to your side until your next<br>rest, you run Scout Companion again,<br>or the companion is targeted by an<br>attack. If you spend an extra Hope, you<br>can call a companion that flies.<br>You can communicate with them, make<br>an Interface Roll to command them to<br>perform simple tasks, and mark a<br>Stress to see through their eyes. When<br>you deal damage to an adversary<br>within Melee range of your companion,<br>you add a d6 to your damage roll.</p>",
